## How the handoff is ordered\
\
**\'a70 is the vault attribution error**, deliberately first. Everything else waits behind it. The "Jen firsthand" tag is in the source record's *filename*, so renaming is part of the fix, and the `[P]` on the setlist order needs re-grading to video-derived.\
\
**\'a75 is the retraction table** \'97 four readings I got wrong, with why. Carried explicitly so they don't quietly resurrect in a session that only sees the conclusions.\
\
**\'a712 is the method cautions**, including the one that cost the most: genre silence isn't absence. Nine Korean blogs recording no stage speech meant those bloggers don't transcribe banter, not that there was none.\
\
## What's genuinely new versus what the vault already had\
\
The vault has the event, a candidate order, the intentional-frame formulation, the lighting census, and the ASR saga. **It does not have:** the eleven-song membership, the Monday guerrilla show in any form, MERCY identified and photographed, the Taegukgi provenance, or the Korean reception body.\
\
The single strongest thing to fold: **the Happy Face card already carried "prototype 
\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  jester face 
\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  face removed" as the mask's terminus.** That was an analytic prediction on the page, and the Korea set performed it physically. A prediction landing is worth more than a reading fitted afterward, and \'a74 flags it that way.\
\
## Two things I'd flag before the new session touches canon\
\
**The three-song spine depends on adjacency.** City of Angels 
\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  Happy Face 
\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  Soul Is A Star is legible, but only membership is solid. If City of Angels didn't directly precede Happy Face, the bracket loosens a lot. It's item 3 in the open list for that reason.\
\
**Your operating frame on the Korean line is recorded verbatim** \'97 delivered because the concepts overlapped with his lore and the audience knew it, nothing more. The line is grounded and quotable; the folktale claim is not, and I've put a standing caution on it. That's the one most likely to harden into false plot fact, because it's the most satisfying.\
\
The new session will have GitHub rather than the REST API, so paths are vault-relative and should map straight across. Field Guide is public \'97 anything committed there is published.\
